      },
      "content": "To  control  the  indoor  fan  motor  as  shown  in  the  table  above  according  to  the  heat  exchange temperature"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0093",
      "reading_order": 155,
      "section": "5.1.2.1 Warm boot",
      "bbox": {
