        "t": 234.06542120000006,
        "r": 550.7879721199996,
        "b": 208.4894418875001
      },
      "content": "The  fan  motor  is  working  slightly  weak  when  the  heat  exchange  temperature  is  above25 ć and below 35 ć"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0095",
